From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0425-mesh-03-first-draw.patch

Source: 0425-mesh-03-first-draw.patch
Apply after core16 + frontend 0182-0410 + mesh-02-next-step.patch.
Generated with OpenAI Codex; local draft, no human sign-off or submission.

Merge mesh/task rescaling and render area into the compute push block,
keeping scratch byte offsets. Push scale and extent before dispatch.
Include guest resources in both dependencies and serialize scratch reuse
across draws on the existing queue. Match indirect access with its stage
between task and scan. No new allocation or enable switch: the existing
EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1 remains off by default.

The emitter harness checks block count and byte offsets. Original scaled
modules fail spirv-val with VUID-06674; patched task/mesh plain/scaled and
readback modules pass for Vulkan 1.3. Changed C++ units pass host syntax
checks. Full CMake/PS5 builds and GPU draws were not tested. Task overflow,
instances, indirect guest draws and omitted outputs remain separate work.
